<v Ira Glass>WBEZ management oversight for our program by our boss, Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, right before today's show, I went to him and said I wasn't sure about doing that Pickle story. But he told me,
<v Ira Glass>我们节目的WBEZ管理监督由我们的老板，托里·马拉蒂亚先生负责。你知道，就在今天的节目之前，我去找他说我不确定是否要做那个皮克尔故事。但他告诉我，

01:00:08.660 --> 01:00:16.580
<v Brandi Smith>You're doing the story. Get over it. You're doing the story. Stop complaining. You're going to go live in 15 minutes. That's it.
<v Brandi Smith>你去做那个故事。别管它。你去做那个报道。别再抱怨了。你还有15分钟就要现场直播了。就是这样。

01:00:16.580 --> 01:00:29.720
<v Ira Glass>I'm Ira Glass. Back next week, with more stories of This American Life .
<v Ira Glass>我是艾拉·格拉斯。下周回来，带来更多《美国生活》的故事。

